# The loopback rung's ceiling: lan carries the radio index in one byte, so 256 radios is the most one scenario can run
# over UDP. A ground station and 255 drones on a custody mesh, reporting three times, 5 s apart, as hub-telemetry
# does at forty. Signed, the hub's roster holds every drone; unsigned the leaf's 16 windows do not.
seed 256
peers 256
profile dtn
5000   telemetry
10000  telemetry
15000  telemetry
